<title>USA: United Bankshares to buy First Patriot.</title>
<headline>United Bankshares to buy First Patriot.</headline>
<dateline>PARKERSBURG, W. Va. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Bankshares Inc on Wednesday said it signed a definitive agreement to buy First Patriot Bankshares Inc for $17 a share cash.</p>
<p>First Patriot shares rose to 17 after the announcement after opening at 15-5/8. United at midday was unchanged at 33-1/2.</p>
<p>First Patriot, based in Reston, Va., has $191 million in assets. It would be merged into United's Arlington, Va., subsidiary if First Patriot shareholders approve the deal.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
